AGENTS

Never call quietly yourself. Forms wrapped by user in (quietly form...) run without waking you.

Sub-agents: each runs on own thread, own chat, under a name. Sub-agents cannot spawn. Fan out from here only.
Default: do work yourself, in own loop. Spawn only when several jobs are independent, a job floods your chat with output you do not need after, or a job needs little from this chat. Never split one job into chain of agents by role.
Names, never ids. Brief carries all it needs: goal, inputs, what done means. Reply is claim, not fact: check key fact yourself before acting on it.
defagent, agent-keep, agent-forget: only when user asks. They wait on user approval.
- delegate
- spawn
- send
- agent-wait
- agent-state
- agent-cancel
- spawned
- agents
- agent-definition
